{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI equivalent of Origami’s "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Interaction","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" patch."}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction\/body(content:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction"}],"externalID":"s:5Swami11InteractionV","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"Interaction","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Drag"],"anchor":"Helpers","title":"Helpers"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Naming (ADR-0010): helpers are named after the Origami ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"patch","type":"text"}]},{"text":", bare (no prefix) —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"disambiguate with the module (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrigamiPatterns.Interaction"},{"text":") if it ever collides. This one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t clash with anything in SwiftUI.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Exposes the Interaction patch’s output ports as bindings\/callbacks so downstream SwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"composes off them, matching the graph:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"down"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" while a finger is on the layer,"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":" — the touch point, in the layer’s coordinate space,"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onTap"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDoubleTap"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onLongPress"},{"text":" — discrete pulses.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Only the gesture for an output you actually request is attached — so a tap-only layer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries only a tap recognizer (no stray drag), which keeps gesture arbitration clean.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction"]}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"s